<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in quiet trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 43.34 to 6660.21.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.24 to 399.40.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.32.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1649 to 905.</p>
<p>Volume was 393,653,080 compared with 468,159,230 on Friday.</p>
